<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST13441"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Elsewhere<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Elsewhere<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, May 05, 2005 - 7:20 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Johno - you explained it really well my exact thoughts on where the trial may be headed...go to the new thread about the poems he wrote from prison and see where he talks about his &#34;black side&#34;...<!--/Text--></td></tr>
