<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST13528"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Ksguy2178<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Ksguy2178<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->11-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, May 07, 2005 - 10:16 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Ken Landwehr is not on the list of witnesses released by the prosecution.  Any ideas why they excluded him?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
